# Minimal 2D SCFT fixture for the FTS_Box tests: a symmetric A/B homopolymer
# blend with Helfand (compressibility) + Flory (chi) potentials, modeled on
# examples/ft/input but on a smaller 32x32 grid for speed.
#
# NOTE: the shipped examples/ft/input is stale relative to the current
# parsers: it says "molecule linear 0.5 ..." where FTS_Molec now requires
# an explicit keyword ("molecule linear phi 0.5 ..."), and it contains a
# "maxSteps" line that FTS_Box::readInput() rejects with die(). This
# fixture uses the current syntax.
box fts scft
Dim 2
grid 32 32
boxLengths 16.0 16.0
species A
species B
Nr 50
rho0 50
molecule linear phi 0.5 1 25 A smear Gaussian 0.15
molecule linear phi 0.5 1 25 B
potential Helfand 50.0 0.1 modify zeromean updateScheme 1S
potential Flory A B 2.9 0.1 0.01 initialize sin 0 0.2 1.0 updateScheme 1S
logFreq 500
randSeed 8675309
endBox
